    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Schedule\"\nsidebar: false\ntoc: false\npage-layout: full\n---\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.schedule-page}\n\nHere's your roadmap for the semester!\n\n- [**Content**](/content/) ({{< fa book-open-reader >}}): This page contains the readings, slides, and recorded lectures for the week. Read the various readings **before** our scheduled class time.\n\n- [**Lesson**](/lesson/index.qmd) ({{< fa chalkboard-teacher >}}): This page contains a tutorial video and additional annotated R code and other supplementary information that you can use to help you prepare for the in-class exercises and assignments. These are most helpful if you watch them before in-class sessions so that you can ask questions when we start working through things together. \n\n- [**Exercises**](/example/) ({{< fa laptop-code >}}): This page the scripts that we work on in class as a reminder of some of the live-coding exercises. These are provided as a reference to help you link your notes to the syntax we use in class.\n\n- [**Assignment**](/assignment/) ({{< fa pen-ruler >}}): This page contains the instructions for each assignment. Assignments are due by *11:59 PM* on the day they're listed. One more time!\n\n::: {.callout-tip}\n\n## Subscribe!\n\nYou can subscribe to this calendar URL in Outlook, Google Calendar, or Apple Calendar:\n\n::: {.grid}\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-2}\n<p class=\"download-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger btn-sm\" href=\"/files/schedule.ics\" role=\"button\">{{< fa calendar-alt >}} Download</a></p>\n:::\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-10}\n<p><input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" value=\"https://isdrfall25.classes.spaseslab.com/files/schedule.ics\" onclick=\"this.select()\" readonly></p>\n:::\n\n:::\n\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n\n### Getting Started \n\n<table class=\"schedule-table table\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:right;\">   </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Title </th>\n   <th style=\"t